  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can see through deceptions and prevarications with ease.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Insightful Gaze<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you make a Sense Motive check to oppose someone’s Bluff check, you add your mythic tier on the check if your opponent is a non-mythic creature, or one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) on the check if your opponent is mythic. If both die roll results are less than 10, as an immediate action you can take 10 on the check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc53\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
